# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SITL and run output. ArduPilot's cwd is the repo root, so its dataflash lands
# in ./logs -- a single 13 h crossing at LOG_BITMASK 65535 is ~3.5 GB.
logs/
*.BIN
eeprom.bin
mav.tlog*
mav.parm

# celestial_node CSV output, and the per-run archives written by
# run_sitl_test.py --run-name. Keep these locally: they are the raw data behind
# docs/images, but a crossing is ~50 MB and they are reproducible from the
# commands recorded in each run directory.
runs/
*.csv
frames/
*.pgm

# NOTE: docs/images/ is deliberately NOT ignored -- README.md and RESULTS.md
# reference those PNGs directly.

# ArduPilot SITL terrain cache, created empty in the repo root at run time.
terrain/
